{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22433","headline":"因沐感发寄朗上人二首 二 · 白居易","name":"因沐感发寄朗上人二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渐少不满把，渐短不盈尺。\n况兹短少中，日夜落复白。\n既无神仙术，何除老死籍。\n祗有解脱门，能度衰苦厄。\n掩镜望东寺，降心谢禅客。\n衰白何足言，剃落犹不惜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}